    "intro_narrative": "The world ended decades ago, leaving behind a scarred wasteland of rusted metal and forgotten technology. You are a scavenger who just discovered a sealed military bunker half-buried in the irradiated dunes. Rumors say this bunker holds a functional atmospheric purifier, a treasure that could save your struggling settlement. However, the outpost is protected by a complex network of ancient computer terminals, biometric lockboxes, and fragmented communication relays. Your objective is to reactivate the automated systems, bypass the military-grade security, and trick the final lockdown validator into granting you access. You'll need to power up the surviving processors, piece together scraps of data, and follow the digital breadcrumbs left by the bunker's final operators before the radioactive sandstorm hits and buries this place forever.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
  },
